{
  "slug": "076zuihouyisheng",
  "title": "This Life Will Be My Last in the Sahā World (Recitation)",
  "excerpt": "I will bid farewell to this Sahā world forever,",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "This Life Will Be My Last in the Sahā World"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "This life,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "will be, in this Sahā world,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "my final life."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "If"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I have come to repay my debts,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "then let me repay as much as I can;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "rather than let others fail me,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I will never fail others,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "so that the surplus I repay"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "may become, for the me who returns,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "a cause that draws me back"
        },
        {
          "s": "("
        },
        {
          "s": "a condition for delivering beings.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I have come to repay kindness,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "then let me repay as much as I can;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "to be born human in this life is no easy thing,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I will bring my humanity to its fullest."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "Whenever I meet with hardship,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "face setbacks,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "feel misunderstood,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "or find my heart unable to be still,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I tell myself:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "this life is already my last life,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I will bid farewell to this Sahā world forever,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "and nothing is worth long brooding over."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "Though for a moment,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "there may now and then be resistance and complaint,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I will quickly remind myself"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "to keep right mindfulness and awareness."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "In this life,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "whatever parents I may have,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "children, beloved, brothers, and sisters,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "whatever friends, companions of the Way, and fellow practitioners I may meet;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "no matter with whom, day by day,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I mingle"
        },
        {
          "s": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I know"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "that between me and them,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "this will be the last life in which we meet,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "the last life of our affinities gathering."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "In this final life,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "to be able to meet them"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "is something I should treasure above all."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "No matter"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "what kind of house I live in now,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "whether my work is satisfying,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "whether my means are ample,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "whether my provisions are sufficient,"
        },
        {
          "s": "(whether my money"
        },
        {
          "s": "is sufficient,)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "none of it matters"
        },
        {
          "s": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "All these were fixed by former lives;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "having walked through this life,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I will never again repeat"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "the same life."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "So,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "let me taste, one last time,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "the flavor of being human."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "This flavor may not be good,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "but it is, left to myself,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "in this world of red dust,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "the last memory."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "In the days of this final life,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "only one thing matters,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "and that is:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "to leave birth and death,"
        },
        {
          "s": "("
        },
        {
          "s": "to depart from birth and death,)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "to transcend the ordinary and the worldly,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "and to realize bodhi."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "However long a life may be,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "it is but a hundred years;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "the years of this life"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "are only, for me in this space,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "a dream and an illusion."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "However I live,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "in joy,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "or in pain,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "in truth it is all"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "a life of the greatest meaning,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "a life worthy of pride,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "a life worthy of cherishing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "Truly,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "this is a joy greater than the heavens."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "After the wisdom-life has endured every calamity in the red dust,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I may at last return to the source of all that is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "What is there left to complain of, to nag over,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "to regret, to rue bitterly, or to resent?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "If there is still any,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "it is because I have forgotten the two words \"the last,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "or because toward these two words \"the last,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "my understanding is not enough,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "and my faith not sufficient."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "Always bear in mind:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "it is my last life in the red dust!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "When I come again,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "I will surely tread upon a lotus,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "coming on the strength of my vow."
        },
        {
          "s": "("
        },
        {
          "s": "to deliver living beings, coming on the strength of my vow.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "Reference reading:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "inline": [
        {
          "s": "Master Lianchi's \"Yibi Gou\" (One Stroke Cancels All)",
          "href": "/articles/098yibigou"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
